    "detailed_description": "Harpy is a &quot;Foddian&quot; game, a difficult platformer with a simple and unique movement system. Climb a spire of floating islands, trek four different levels with fresh challenges and hazards, and try not to fall all the way down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore a basic area to really feel the movement, a mushroom zone with moving platforms, a cloud section with fading blocks and timing challenges, and then finally the temples, with lightning on top of everything you've seen before.<br />\r\nThis game also features numerous easter eggs to bring different platforming challenges to the table, keeping the game fresh and replayable.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to master Harpy and speedrun the game? I'll warn you, it isn't easy.",
